(6876624, 1036216, 137576, '<td valign="top">now a ? on faith would have been even more apt :), gotta be Christophe, love the detail and the naturalness of it, thats what im struggling with subtle blending its my next thing to learn.</td>', 'now a ? on faith would have been even more apt :), gotta be Christophe, love the detail and the naturalness of it, thats what im struggling with subtle blending its my next thing to learn.', '2012-10-05 17:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
