(6876639, 1036198, 134859, '<td valign="top">Overall, I''m just not feeling this shot.  <br/>A combination of the foreground blur, there''s a distinct line running across the photo and you can read "nald''s"  Just not understanding that?<br/>The vignette is more distracting than interesting<br/>And in the far background, you can see a house that looks like it''s in perfect condition.  <br/> <br/>The thumbnail of the shot actually looked very interesting, however.</td>', 'Overall, I''m just not feeling this shot.  A combination of the foreground blur, there''s a distinct line running across the photo and you can read "nald''s"  Just not understanding that?The vignette is more distracting than interestingAnd in the far background, you can see a house that looks like it''s in perfect condition.   The thumbnail of the shot actually looked very interesting, however.', '2012-10-05 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876640, 1035939, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract shot.  <br/>I like the colors.<br/>Just don''t get the interpretation of the challenge?</td>', 'Beautiful abstract shot.  I like the colors.Just don''t get the interpretation of the challenge?', '2012-10-05 18:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876641, 1036216, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is my FAVORITE shot of the bunch!<br/> <br/>LOVE the post-apocalyptic look.  Yet very real look.  <br/> <br/>The title along with the man, seemingly looking upward, entices the viewer to have sympathy, yet compassion, for the man.  The birds flying in the left of the photo also add the "life" to the photo... yet a darkness as well.<br/> <br/>This is perfectly done!  <br/> <br/>Only 10 I gave.  :)</td>', 'This is my FAVORITE shot of the bunch! LOVE the post-apocalyptic look.  Yet very real look.   The title along with the man, seemingly looking upward, entices the viewer to have sympathy, yet compassion, for the man.  The birds flying in the left of the photo also add the "life" to the photo... yet a darkness as well. This is perfectly done!   Only 10 I gave.  :)', '2012-10-05 18:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876642, 1035972, 38162, '<td valign="top">terrific title.</td>', 'terrific title.', '2012-10-05 18:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876643, 1036115, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  <br/>I love photographs like this.  <br/> <br/>I think a little less "green" and it would have been even better.  Perhaps the plants dying, or at least a brownish shade?<br/> <br/>Still, I gave this an 8, since I am drawn to photos like this, and I like it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I love photographs like this.   I think a little less "green" and it would have been even better.  Perhaps the plants dying, or at least a brownish shade? Still, I gave this an 8, since I am drawn to photos like this, and I like it.', '2012-10-05 18:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876645, 1036286, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.<br/> <br/>The lone stuffed animale, a monkey, I think?<br/> <br/>The leaves gathered around...<br/> <br/>The warm colors are nice.  The only thing I would say to improve would be the horizon is slightly tilted.  It appears.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I love the shot!  Very well done.  Fitting title.  NICE!</td>', 'I really like this shot. The lone stuffed animale, a monkey, I think? The leaves gathered around... The warm colors are nice.  The only thing I would say to improve would be the horizon is slightly tilted.  It appears. Other than that, I love the shot!  Very well done.  Fitting title.  NICE!', '2012-10-05 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876790, 1036216, 29906, '<td valign="top">By far best shot in this challenge. The only one worth a 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'By far best shot in this challenge. The only one worth a 10 in my opinion.', '2012-10-05 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
