(6878635, 1036316, 147314, '<td valign="top">Maybe I can judge this image as being creative, but I think it is too easy this way. Maybe some high key picture would have been better. [voted earlier]</td>', 'Maybe I can judge this image as being creative, but I think it is too easy this way. Maybe some high key picture would have been better. [voted earlier]', '2012-10-08 14:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878641, 1036318, 147314, '<td valign="top">I admire the amount of work and processing that has made up this image, but for me it is too unrealistic, especially the character on the foreground [voted earlier].</td>', 'I admire the amount of work and processing that has made up this image, but for me it is too unrealistic, especially the character on the foreground [voted earlier].', '2012-10-08 14:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878644, 1036324, 147314, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the processing is any good. It looks like a kind of jigsaw puzzle and some of the pieces don''t seem to match very well. [voted earlier]</td>', 'I don''t think the processing is any good. It looks like a kind of jigsaw puzzle and some of the pieces don''t seem to match very well. [voted earlier]', '2012-10-08 14:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878646, 1036196, 147314, '<td valign="top">This image is more like some impressionistic art form (very nice), but (to me) doesn''t result in a realistic picture of some post-apocalyptic event. The title is a bit strange as well (but probably because I don''t know St. Louis :-). [voted earlier]</td>', 'This image is more like some impressionistic art form (very nice), but (to me) doesn''t result in a realistic picture of some post-apocalyptic event. The title is a bit strange as well (but probably because I don''t know St. Louis :-). [voted earlier]', '2012-10-08 14:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878650, 1036205, 147314, '<td valign="top">Like this image very much, I can see the world being changed into a huge destructive fire, causing the animals and the birds to flee. VWD! [voted earlier]</td>', 'Like this image very much, I can see the world being changed into a huge destructive fire, causing the animals and the birds to flee. VWD! [voted earlier]', '2012-10-08 14:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878657, 1036180, 147314, '<td valign="top">I can only see some point and shoot game in this image and most of it doesn''t seem in focus. [voted earlier]</td>', 'I can only see some point and shoot game in this image and most of it doesn''t seem in focus. [voted earlier]', '2012-10-08 14:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878665, 1036198, 147314, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the idea but unfortunately the processing seems a bit clumsy. Especially the transition from waves to calmer water and the text underneath the McDonald''s sign is quite unrealistic. The vignetting doesn''t work for me either [voted earlier].</td>', 'I can appreciate the idea but unfortunately the processing seems a bit clumsy. Especially the transition from waves to calmer water and the text underneath the McDonald''s sign is quite unrealistic. The vignetting doesn''t work for me either [voted earlier].', '2012-10-08 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878673, 1036316, 134859, '<td valign="top">If this was the first time I had seen a shot done like this, I would have voted it higher.<br/>But the fact that the idea has been overdone, dissuaded me from voting this image higher.</td>', 'If this was the first time I had seen a shot done like this, I would have voted it higher.But the fact that the idea has been overdone, dissuaded me from voting this image higher.', '2012-10-08 14:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878674, 1036313, 134859, '<td valign="top">It seems there is too much green (color wise) in this shot, and it appears a little too sharp, IMO.  Also, the big leaves in the bottom left are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'It seems there is too much green (color wise) in this shot, and it appears a little too sharp, IMO.  Also, the big leaves in the bottom left are somewhat distracting.', '2012-10-08 14:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
