(6879169, 1036216, 143116, '<td valign="top">Perfect, in almost every aspect. The messiah must be close, since the rays from the upper windows appear to come at a different angle than the ones below.</td>', 'Perfect, in almost every aspect. The messiah must be close, since the rays from the upper windows appear to come at a different angle than the ones below.', '2012-10-09 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880059, 1036198, 93565, '<td valign="top">The text at the bottom of the golden arches sign is a blemish on the editing, certainly. The waves crashing into your scene are blurred in a heavy handed fashion, but it''s much more forgivable except where the Micky D''s text is, where it is very glaring.</td>', 'The text at the bottom of the golden arches sign is a blemish on the editing, certainly. The waves crashing into your scene are blurred in a heavy handed fashion, but it''s much more forgivable except where the Micky D''s text is, where it is very glaring.', '2012-10-10 06:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880063, 1036039, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is some sort of sporting event? It would be awesome to see some crisp detail in the raindrops and individuals. Expert isn''t needed here, and perhaps you were limited by ISO performance, but I''d bump it by a stop at least. Good potential.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is some sort of sporting event? It would be awesome to see some crisp detail in the raindrops and individuals. Expert isn''t needed here, and perhaps you were limited by ISO performance, but I''d bump it by a stop at least. Good potential.', '2012-10-10 06:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880065, 1036318, 93565, '<td valign="top">A decent use of expert editing, but your light source is inconsistent throughout the scene. It''s also odd to have a 25mph speed limit on what is obviously a freeway/highway, and the zombie on the overpass is very out of proportion.<br/> <br/>Vision is very good, editing is pretty good, clean up the minutiae and you have a winner.</td>', 'A decent use of expert editing, but your light source is inconsistent throughout the scene. It''s also odd to have a 25mph speed limit on what is obviously a freeway/highway, and the zombie on the overpass is very out of proportion. Vision is very good, editing is pretty good, clean up the minutiae and you have a winner.', '2012-10-10 06:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880068, 1036216, 93565, '<td valign="top">I looked at the thumbnails before looking individually, and I didn''t see one that outright said Christophe. After progressing through voting and coming upon this, I''m pretty sure this is yours. I say that neutrally, but the bleakness of message leads me to believe I''m right, along with the great editing.<br/> <br/>Very interesting shot. The angle of the beams through the lower windows doesn''t match those of the upper windows, but this is minor, and the shot is very well composed and edited. Very, very nice.</td>', 'I looked at the thumbnails before looking individually, and I didn''t see one that outright said Christophe. After progressing through voting and coming upon this, I''m pretty sure this is yours. I say that neutrally, but the bleakness of message leads me to believe I''m right, along with the great editing. Very interesting shot. The angle of the beams through the lower windows doesn''t match those of the upper windows, but this is minor, and the shot is very well composed and edited. Very, very nice.', '2012-10-10 06:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880074, 1036314, 93565, '<td valign="top">I feel like this could''ve been made much more interesting visually and with some more variety. At the very lest, using a different eye and changing how the two of you looked a bit would have helped things. For having uniforms etc, I expected a bit more, myself.</td>', 'I feel like this could''ve been made much more interesting visually and with some more variety. At the very lest, using a different eye and changing how the two of you looked a bit would have helped things. For having uniforms etc, I expected a bit more, myself.', '2012-10-10 06:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880076, 1036199, 93565, '<td valign="top">A great photo, but for this challenge, shoehorn if ever there was one.</td>', 'A great photo, but for this challenge, shoehorn if ever there was one.', '2012-10-10 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6880077, 1036213, 93565, '<td valign="top">The bleakness of this is remarkable. You took a common scene, added to it, and made a photo that fits the challenge exceptionally. I wonder how many will notice the two individuals upon the beach, but this is my fave for the challenge and I''m giving you a 9.</td>', 'The bleakness of this is remarkable. You took a common scene, added to it, and made a photo that fits the challenge exceptionally. I wonder how many will notice the two individuals upon the beach, but this is my fave for the challenge and I''m giving you a 9.', '2012-10-10 06:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
