(6881438, 1036324, 77196, '<td valign="top">I was editing merrily away on this when I glanced at the clock.  11:57!! I did a quick resize, save, upload. This is a composite of 4 images. Foreground, background, sky, and court house. I would love to go back and finish the edit. Too much wrong or unfinished with this to even discuss!<br/></td>', 'I was editing merrily away on this when I glanced at the clock.  11:57!! I did a quick resize, save, upload. This is a composite of 4 images. Foreground, background, sky, and court house. I would love to go back and finish the edit. Too much wrong or unfinished with this to even discuss!', '2012-10-12 01:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
