(6881682, 1036226, 67152, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> 6 ones, wow!!! Might of been the Americans, I can see this happening one day! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I really doubt it has to do with national pride issues.  There have been more than a few comments in the threads from some members that they felt that expert entries need to look at feel like ''photographs'' (as per the rules set) and not photoshopped combinations.  I think your shot and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=131871" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Samantha_T</a>''s entry both suffered the ''1''s because they looked like photoshop works rather than photographs.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: 6 ones, wow!!! Might of been the Americans, I can see this happening one day!   I really doubt it has to do with national pride issues.  There have been more than a few comments in the threads from some members that they felt that expert entries need to look at feel like ''photographs'' (as per the rules set) and not photoshopped combinations.  I think your shot and  Samantha_T''s entry both suffered the ''1''s because they looked like photoshop works rather than photographs.', '2012-10-12 11:39:16.000000', NULL, 0),
