(6881748, 1036226, 109387, '<td valign="top">To tell the truth I have to say that Samantha''s image is quite different from mine. My image has a lot of photographic elements and a realistic ''feel'' (not enough to judge it a photo but less unrealistic than my Sagittarius entry). Some of those 1s could be attributed to some sort of American pride IMHO. In any case this was not intended as something against USA, but against humankind in general because of its attempt of destroying this world).<br/> <br/>At the end of the story it''s my fault, this image could have been better, and next time it will :)</td>', 'To tell the truth I have to say that Samantha''s image is quite different from mine. My image has a lot of photographic elements and a realistic ''feel'' (not enough to judge it a photo but less unrealistic than my Sagittarius entry). Some of those 1s could be attributed to some sort of American pride IMHO. In any case this was not intended as something against USA, but against humankind in general because of its attempt of destroying this world). At the end of the story it''s my fault, this image could have been better, and next time it will :)', '2012-10-12 12:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6881761, 1036315, 63218, '<td valign="top">Came back to look at this one, I gave it a 10 for its whimsy. Now that I''ve read the notes I''m more impressed. It seems difficult to put several photos together into an interesting composition without loosing the moment of discovery for the viewer. Well done. Cats rule!</td>', 'Came back to look at this one, I gave it a 10 for its whimsy. Now that I''ve read the notes I''m more impressed. It seems difficult to put several photos together into an interesting composition without loosing the moment of discovery for the viewer. Well done. Cats rule!', '2012-10-12 12:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
