(6882103, 1036216, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, Christophe. I never dreamed that it was three different churches! I love the light rays. I was thinking about those in a different challenge, and never had the nerve to even try. Wonderfully done -- and I continue to look forward to each description. They''re even more fun that the creations. :)</td>', 'This is so beautiful, Christophe. I never dreamed that it was three different churches! I love the light rays. I was thinking about those in a different challenge, and never had the nerve to even try. Wonderfully done -- and I continue to look forward to each description. They''re even more fun that the creations. :)', '2012-10-12 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
